[[!meta title="Testing perl5lib"]]

[[!toc levels=1]]

<a id="build-deps"></a>

Install build and test dependencies
===================================

    "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)"/bin/install-perl5lib-build-deps

Run the test suite
==================

    cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/config/chroot_local-includes/usr/src/perl5lib" && \
    dzil test --all
